
### 6. `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Ansible
*.retry
.vault_password
vault_password

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.secret
secrets/
credentials/

# SSH
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Local configuration
config/local/
ansible/inventory/local/

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db